			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3910595">
									

<p>I liked the idea of readers substituting redactions for what they considered the most terrifying - do you find the idea of just 5 entities scarier, because it gives it a personal touch? Or do you think a large number really reinforces a feeling of helplessness? The time was meant to be similar - how long are these creatures looking over you before you wake up? I personally found that to be more horrifying than giving distinct numbers, but you're the second person now to mention they felt the redaction unnecessary, so it seems like I missed the mark. I'll probably remove them.</p>

